-- Appendix T directory suite (packageMode).
-- §8.1: "In package mode, [an explicit module header] MUST match the
-- path-derived module name (compile-time error otherwise)."  lib.kp
-- declares `module wrongname` while its path-derived name is `lib`:
-- exactly one structured error, anchored in lib.kp at the header line,
-- and the unrelated main.kp still elaborates without cascade.
--! mode check
--! packageMode
--! assertErrorCount 1
--! assertDiagnostic error E_MODULE_PATH_MISMATCH
--! assertDiagnosticAt lib.kp error E_MODULE_PATH_MISMATCH 1
-- STATUS(a0497523): PASS — single E_MODULE_PATH_MISMATCH "module header 'wrongname' does not match the path-derived module name 'lib'" at lib.kp:1
